    <!-- About Dialog Content -->
    <string name="about_dialog_title">NoteTrail: IGCSE Past Paper Tracker</string>
    <string name="about_dialog_subtitle">Master your IGCSE journey with NoteTrail.</string>
    <string name="about_dialog_body">Built by a student, for students, NoteTrail is the ultimate companion for 10th-grade boards. Stop getting lost in folders of PDFs and start tracking your progress with precision. Whether you are tackling Biology, Physics, Chemistry, or French, NoteTrail keeps your study trail organized.\n\n<b>Key Features:</b>\n\n<b>Past Paper Tracker:</b> Log every paper you solve and monitor your score trends.\n\n<b>Syllabus Focus:</b> Designed specifically around the IGCSE curriculum.\n\n<b>Secure &amp; Private:</b> Your data is yours. We use high-level encryption to ensure your notes and progress stay private.\n\n<b>Student-Centric Design:</b> No clutter, no unnecessary ads—just pure productivity.</string>
    <string name="about_dialog_dev_header">The Developer</string>
    <string name="about_dialog_dev_info">NoteTrail is an independent project developed by Mechanical Axiom.\nLead Developer: <b>Sahil</b>.\n\nMy goal is to bridge the gap between complex engineering concepts and everyday utility. NoteTrail was born out of the necessity to stay organized during my own board exams, and now it\'s here to help you \"smash\" yours too.</string>

